{"id":"torrey:gardens","source":"torrey","name":"Gardens","slug":"gardens","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Often made by the banks of rivers — Nu 24:6.","refs":[["Num",24,6,24,6]]},{"text":"Herbs. — De 11:10; 1Ki 21:2.","refs":[["Deut",11,10,11,10],["1Kgs",21,2,21,2]]},{"text":"Cucumbers. — Isa 1:8.","refs":[["Isa",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"Fruit trees. — Ec 2:5,6.","refs":[["Eccl",2,5,2,5],["Eccl",2,6,2,6]]},{"text":"Spices, &c. — Song 4:16; 6:2.","refs":[["Song",4,16,4,16],["Song",6,2,6,2]]},{"text":"Often enclosed — Song 4:12.","refs":[["Song",4,12,4,12]]},{"text":"Often refreshed by fountains — Song 4:15.","refs":[["Song",4,15,4,15]]},{"text":"Taken care of by gardeners — Joh 20:15.","refs":[["John",20,15,20,15]]},{"text":"Lodges erected in — Isa 1:8.","refs":[["Isa",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"Entertainments. — Song 5:1.","refs":[["Song",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"Retirement. — Joh 18:1.","refs":[["John",18,1,18,1]]},{"text":"Burial places. — 2Ki 21:18,26; Joh 19:41.","refs":[["2Kgs",21,18,21,18],["2Kgs",21,26,21,26],["John",19,41,19,41]]},{"text":"Idolatrous worship. — Isa 1:29; 65:3.","refs":[["Isa",1,29,1,29],["Isa",65,3,65,3]]},{"text":"Blasting of, a punishment — Am 4:9.","refs":[["Amos",4,9,4,9]]},{"text":"Jews ordered to plant, in Babylon — Jer 29:5,28.","refs":[["Jer",29,5,29,5],["Jer",29,28,29,28]]},{"text":"Planted by the Lord. — Ge 2:8.","refs":[["Gen",2,8,2,8]]},{"text":"Called the garden of the Lord. — Ge 13:10.","refs":[["Gen",13,10,13,10]]},{"text":"Called the garden of God. — Eze 28:13.","refs":[["Ezek",28,13,28,13]]},{"text":"Had every tree good for food. — Ge 2:9.","refs":[["Gen",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"Watered by a river. — Ge 2:10-14.","refs":[["Gen",2,10,2,14]]},{"text":"Man placed in, to dress and keep. — Ge 2:8,15.","refs":[["Gen",2,8,2,8],["Gen",2,15,2,15]]},{"text":"Man driven from, after the fall. — Ge 3:23,24.","refs":[["Gen",3,23,3,23],["Gen",3,24,3,24]]},{"text":"Fertility of Canaan like. — Ge 13:10; Joe 2:3.","refs":[["Gen",13,10,13,10],["Joel",2,3,2,3]]},{"text":"The future state of the Jews shall be like. — Isa 51:3; Eze 36:35.","refs":[["Isa",51,3,51,3],["Ezek",36,35,36,35]]},{"text":"Of the church. — Song 5:1; 6:2,11.","refs":[["Song",5,1,5,1],["Song",6,2,6,2],["Song",6,11,6,11]]},{"text":"(Enclosed,) of the pleasantness, fruitfulness, and security of the church. — Song 4:12.","refs":[["Song",4,12,4,12]]},{"text":"(Well watered,) of spiritual prosperity of the church. — Isa 58:11; Jer 31:12.","refs":[["Isa",58,11,58,11],["Jer",31,12,31,12]]},{"text":"(When dried up,) of the wicked. — Isa 1:30.","refs":[["Isa",1,30,1,30]]}],"refCount":42}
